{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;0181-TBC-A-90010181 Rev A -&amp;nbsp; Existing Site Plan; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0181-TBC-A-9002 Rev A Proposed Site Plan; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0181-TBC-A-9003 Rev C - Site Location Plan; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Covering Letter by M&amp;amp;S; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Container Specifications; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Flood Risk Assessment (received 30.10.24)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;All documents received 02.10.24, unless otherwise stated&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Any plant and machinery within the container shall be so installed; operated and maintained thereafter retained as much as practicable to prevent the transmission of noise and vibration into any neighbouring premises. The level of noise emitted from the container including that used for ventilation, refrigeration, air conditioning and fume extraction shall be lower than the existing background level by at least 10LpA. Noise levels shall be determined at one meter from the window of the nearest noise sensitive premises. The background noise level shall be expressed as the lowest LA 90 (10 minutes) during which plant is or may be in operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The cold storage container hereby permitted shall only be erected on or after the 1st of November, and be removed and the land restored to its former condition by the 31st January each year until 31st January 2029.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
